    FR  [4.1.REQ-5] The system shall store the information in the database.

[4.2] Account Login
    FR  [4.2.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered user to log-in to their account.
    FR  [4.2.REQ-2] The system shall require a username and password from the user.
    FR  [4.2.REQ-3] The system will verify the username and password, and the user will be considered “logged-in”.

[4.3] Search
    FR  [4.3.REQ-1] The users can search for the book of their choice as well as a print shop.

[4.3.1] Search a Book Stimulus: Click "Search a Book" Button
    FR  [4.3.1.REQ-1] The system shall allow a user to search for books by title, author or ISBN number.
    FR  [4.3.1.REQ-2] The search results will include a list of matching books with picture of the front cover, along with the title, author, price, availability, and condition of t…

[4.3.2] Search a Print Shop Stimulus: Click "Search a Print Shop" Button
    FR  [4.3.2.REQ-1] The system shall allow a user to search for print shops.
    FR  [4.3.2.REQ-2] The search results will include a list of available print shops with there opening time , closing time and rates.

[4.4] Add to Shopping Cart
    FR  [4.4.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to temporarily save books that are being considered for purchase into a list associated with their accou…
    FR  [4.4.REQ-2] When viewing the shopping cart list, the system shall display the total price of the books in the cart.

[4.5] Delete
    FR  [4.5.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to remove any unwanted books from their shopping cart.
    FR  [4.5.REQ-2] The system shall provide the user a way to select one of the books in his/ her cart for deletion.
    FR  [4.5.REQ-3] After the user has indicated the particular book to be deleted from their shopping cart, the stored list representing the shopping cart should be updated by re…

[4.6] Rent
    FR  [4.6.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to rent-out books that are in their shopping cart.
    FR  [4.6.REQ-2] The system shall prompt the user to enter time period for renting out the books in the cart.
    FR  [4.6.REQ-3] The system shall display rent charged for the period of rental and individual rent of the books in the shopping cart.
    FR  [4.6.REQ-4] The system shall allow the user to enter their delivery information.
    FR  [4.6.REQ-5] After a successful transaction user system shall prompt the user to enter their payment information.
    FR  [4.6.REQ-6] On a successful transaction the books (titles and prices and quantities) will be displayed to the screen.

[4.7] Purchase
    FR  [4.7.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to purchase books that are in their shopping cart.
    FR  [4.7.REQ-2] The system shall display total cost of the books in the shopping cart.
    FR  [4.7.REQ-3] The system shall allow the user to enter their delivery information.
    FR  [4.7.REQ-4] After a successful transaction user system shall prompt the user to enter their payment information.
    FR  [4.7.REQ-5] On a successful transaction the books (titles and prices and quantities) will be displayed to the screen.

[4.8] Print
    FR  [4.8.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to request a print from a chosen print shop.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-2] The system shall prompt the user to enter the url of the google drive link of the soft copy to be printed.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-3] The system shall display the total cost of printing the soft copy.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-4] The system shall allow the user to enter their delivery information.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-5] After a successful transaction user system shall prompt the user to enter their payment information.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-6] On a successful transaction the delivery status will the displayed.

[4.9] Add Book
    FR  [4.9.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user , bookstores and printing stores to add books they want to sell / print / rent-out.
    FR  [4.9.REQ-2] The user shall be prompted to ﬁll in a form with all details associated with the class ‘Book’ : name , quantity , options for lending or selling , ISBN number …
    FR  [4.9.REQ-3] The system shall allow the user to enter their payment acceptance details like bank account number , IFSC Code etc.

[4.10] Request a Restock
    FR  [4.10.REQ-1] The system shall allow a user to view various methods of contacting the sellers(bookstore ,printstore or the student sharing the book).
    FR  [4.10.REQ-2] The system shall display the store address, telephone number, email address, and directions on how to get to the the sellers(bookstore ,printstore or the stude…
    FR  [4.10.REQ-3] The system should also display a map showing the location of the bookstores and printing stores.

[4.11] Update Account Information
    FR  [4.11.REQ-1] The system shall allow a user to update the information in their account.
    FR  [4.11.REQ-2] The user shall be allowed to view and change their name, mailing address, billing address, payment information.
    FR  [4.11.REQ-3] The user shall be able to change their password by entering the old one once, and a new one twice.

[4.12] View Delivery Status
    FR  [4.12.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to view the shipping status of orders they have placed within the last 30 days.
    FR  [4.12.REQ-2] The user must enter a conﬁrmation number to view the shipping status of their order.
    FR  [4.12.REQ-3] The system shall then display the shipping date, mailing address, projected delivery date, and status (in transit, delivered, etc.)

[4.13] View Account Purchase History
    FR  [4.13.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to view purchases made with their account within the last two years.
    FR  [4.13.REQ-2] The system shall display the date of purchase, payment mode.
    FR  [4.13.REQ-3] The system shall display the title of the book, price, and quantity for each book purchased in a given order.

