    FR  [4.14.REQ-1] The system shall allow the registered and logged-in user to exit his/her account, so that access to operations requiring a user to be logged in are now disable…

[4.15] Help
    FR  [4.15.REQ-1] The system shall allow the user to view an overview of how to use the various operations deﬁned above.
    FR  [4.15.REQ-2] The system must allow the user to select one of the operations by name.
    FR  [4.15.REQ-3] The system shall then display information on how to use that operation.

